Proof.
  intros fr0 fr cs C A A5 Ab m mb mdb regs0 R s w h d skel arrs rkel arrr rowss rowsr ret S kR bR k b
    CK HW Hz Hs16 Hstk Hsc Hret H02 H04 CF Rs Rr HRsp HR HF PM KOs KOr KA KA5 KL5 RES Hroom HkR HbR POST.
  pose proof CK as [T1 T2 T3 T4 T5]. cbn [snd ll_img LLU16] in T5. pose proof LSTK_val as HLS. unfold BBE_WIN in Hstk.
